OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore support needed for unpaid
OL,4,Acarers, MP urges
OL,5,
OL,6,FSharing personal stories of
OL,7,Fconstituents who "look after family
OL,8,Fmembers, friends and loved ones, often
OL,9,Fwithout help and at considerable
OL,10,Fpersonal cost", she said: "No one
OL,11,Fshould be pushed into poverty caring
OL,12,Ffor someone they love."
OL,14,FJames Frith, Parliamentary Under
OL,15,FSecretary of State for Health and
OL,16,FSocial Care, said: "This government is
OL,17,Facting now to ensure the right support
OL,18,Fat the right time."
